{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2017a-k2.q29.material.recovered", "text": "材料：某校历史教师在命制期末考试题中，找到如下一段史料：“国朝设关之初， 番舶入市者，仅二十余柁（艘）······舶长日大班，次日二班，得居停十三行，余悉守舶，仍明代怀远驿旁建屋居番人制也”。据此，该教师命制了一道单项选择题：史载：“国朝设关之初，番舶入市者，仅二十余柁（艘）······得居停十三行。余悉守舶”。此材料反映了“国朝”的经济政策是：A.严禁通“番”B.限制外贸C.打击走私D.杜绝外贸答案", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b20eac82f7b5e9dba55ca6ab27f544487537f96aeb09ebb3b23c9801c5df279f", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3179, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3381, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 29, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "b20eac82f7b5e9dba55ca6ab27f544487537f96aeb09ebb3b23c9801c5df279f"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2017a-k2.q29"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s3.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s4.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.310.r006", "ntce.outline.310.r019", "ntce.outline.316.r007", "ntce.outline.316.r008"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2017a-k2.q29"], "word_count": 202, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "lishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b20eac82f7b5e9dba55ca6ab27f544487537f96aeb09ebb3b23c9801c5df279f", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3179, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3381, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "quest