{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2017a-k2.q30.material.recovered", "text": "材料一：《义务教育历史课程标准（2011年版）》规定，通过北魏孝文帝改革，初步理解民族交往、交流、交融对中华民族发展的意义。材料二： 课文摘录：北魏孝文帝的改革措施迁都以前，孝文帝就进行了政治、经济改革；迁都以后，进一步实行改革， 主要的措施包括：在朝廷中必须使用汉语，禁用鲜卑语；官员及家属必须穿戴汉族服饰；将鲜卑族的姓氏改为汉族姓氏，把皇族由姓拓跋改为姓元；鼓励鲜卑贵族与汉族贵族联姻；采用汉族的官制、律令；学习汉族的礼法，尊崇孔子，以孝治国，提倡尊老、养老的风气等。这些措施促进了民族融合。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b20eac82f7b5e9dba55ca6ab27f544487537f96aeb09ebb3b23c9801c5df279f", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3473, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3721, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 30, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "b20eac82f7b5e9dba55ca6ab27f544487537f96aeb09ebb3b23c9801c5df279f"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2017a-k2.q30"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s1.k01", "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s2.k01", "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.310.r004", "ntce.outline.310.r009", "ntce.outline.316.r006", "ntce.outline.316.r007", "ntce.outline.316.r010", "ntce.outline.316.r017"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2017a-k2.q30"], "word_count": 248, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "lishi", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b20eac82f7b5e9dba55ca6ab27f544487537f96aeb09ebb3b23c9801c5df279f", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3473, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3721, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alig